Package: hvtiRtemplates
Type: Package
Title: Analysis Job Templates for the HVTI CORR Group
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-08-14
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "John", "Ehrlinger",
      email = "john.ehrlinger@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Maintainer: John Ehrlinger <john.ehrlinger@gmail.com>
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiRtemplates,
    https://ehrlinger.github.io/hvtiRtemplates/
BugReports: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiRtemplates/issues
Description: Versioned analysis job templates for the clinical investigations
  statistics group within The Heart \& Vascular Institute at the Cleveland
  Clinic. Provides the analysis-prefix taxonomy the group organises jobs by,
  and resolves a template name to an installed file, so that a study binds to
  a versioned template rather than to a copy.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
